  "notes": "cw_oatmeal master (32) + portrait_ext (7: + oat_0 warm mauve coat line, darker than oat_1) for r12 illustrations. Oatmeal coat (2 tones, no near-white so it never merges with snow) with camel piping (keeps it off the snow), teal beanie/scarf/mittens, cream pom. Darkest hair + charcoal pants anchor the value read; lightest-coat option, weakest on snow. Default hair: espresso; alternates in hair_espresso / hair_auburn / hair_blueblack. | r10 outline decision: sel-out line_colors; eyes use ink so the outline index is exterior-only (engine swaps it to a light rim on dark tiles).",
